c5/uploads/origins/8b11d5e1-be46-4c3e-a64d-4c54d2ffc441?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=099b67aeeea5f72628d3214548ea5809 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "I'd love a picture of my nervous fox boy, who has a cute and youthful face, but with a hulking and gigantic body. Stretching his clothes, showing his big soft, almost teddy beat like body underneath. Sweat patches on his clothes. Looking blushing and nervous, like he's just grown larger and can't control it. Some small puffs of stink around him.\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/R6xgFch", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@marototori/works/121", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/02b4bde4/uploads/origins/32f4b790-d68e-475f-ada2-a914fdb9c1ae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=943dfc9f40de180149010f0a7a028424", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/02b4bde4/uploads/origins/32f4b790-d68e-475f-ada2-a914fdb9c1ae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=943dfc9f40de180149010f0a7a028424, https://si.imgix.net/02b4bde4/uploads/origins/32f4b790-d68e-475f-ada2-a914fdb9c1ae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5071d6ff79b2f76c8d701850c3710d9d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/02b4bde4/uploads/origins/32f4b790-d68e-475f-ada2-a914fdb9c1ae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=99f853690cbe3d57f63a47cdda245733 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "こんにちは！私の若い狼男OC、マーカスの全身デッサンが欲しいです！彼はとても優しくて陽気な性格で、表情は牙を見せて幸せそうに笑っています。服装は破れたデニムのショートパンツ。大きな胸と、筋肉質な肩、腕、胴体を見せるためにシャツは脱いでいる。全体的に体毛が多く、胸筋の間は濃い。股間からは少し毛深い宝のような跡があり、ショーツの中で膨らみがよく見える。金色の目、尖った耳、手足には黒い爪がある。ポーズは、足を前に出して座っている。\n\n可能であれば、全裸で勃起し、先端から精液が垂れているバージョンも欲しい。\n\nキャラクターデザイン参照：https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1KliYqMzogAd_jsfx23e4DWVsSf_nc1ZW\nSize/Pose Ref: https://x.com/marototori/status/1965067142216429616?s=61\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1KliYqMzogAd_jsfx23e4DWVsSf_nc1ZW", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@marototori/works/120", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/57e8e40e/uploads/origins/85ad2618-ae65-4b05-8e54-19a9ac80e4c6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1cd3aad55480959dac6ee1331f249ecd", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/57e8e40e/uploads/origins/85ad2618-ae65-4b05-8e54-19a9ac80e4c6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1cd3aad55480959dac6ee1331f249ecd, https://si.imgix.net/57e8e40e/uploads/origins/85ad2618-ae65-4b05-8e54-19a9ac80e4c6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=027caa2f850ad53331f40d83b51cda5e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/57e8e40e/uploads/origins/85ad2618-ae65-4b05-8e54-19a9ac80e4c6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=69ebc9278f25555ff0de2365f5841121 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "こんにちは！\n\n大きなオークが筋肉を伸ばし、服を引き裂く。\n咆哮/興奮/獰猛な表情。\n紫色の音符／魔法の霧を周りに含めることができる。\n\n大きな膨らみ／ペニスがズボンから破裂し、先走り汁が漏れる。\n\n完全にあなた次第。\n\n参考文献\nhttps://x.com/TheOrcBard/status/1944576145783128250/photo/1\nhttps://x.com/TheOrcBard/status/1789940514088739039/photo/1\nhttps://x.com/TheOrcBard/status/1762458475089809455/photo/1", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@marototori/works/119", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/a4b567ec/uploads/origins/4f9dcdfa-cfc4-4b3f-87b2-766a94e839b0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b1a56bec34c495478479a0ca46913b3d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a4b567ec/uploads/origins/4f9dcdfa-cfc4-4b3f-87b2-766a94e839b0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b1a56bec34c495478479a0ca46913b3d, https://si.imgix.net/a4b567ec/uploads/origins/4f9dcdfa-cfc4-4b3f-87b2-766a94e839b0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f2a761cdf88939f92dedfe2ee398ef15 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a4b567ec/uploads/origin